      "structure_description": "A discrete tridecanuclear lanthaball retains the [Ce13(CO3)14] core of α-1Ce. Six nitrate counteranions replace the chloride/carbonate lattice counteranions; surface aqua ligands hydrogen-bond through lattice water to nitrate. Sodium is inferred as the charge-balancing countercation from elemental analysis, rather than located crystallographically.",
