        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "ph": null,
        "procedure": "Add methanolic Ce(NO3)3·6H2O to methanolic (Et4N)(ccnm), followed by methanolic 1,10-phenanthroline monohydrate and aqueous NaHCO3. A suspension forms immediately. After one week, manually separate the orange needles and wash with methanol. An alternate preparation uses aqueous Na2CO3, giving a white precipitate before the phenanthroline and ccnm salt are added; orange crystals then form after one month.",
